# tmux-subagent UI/UX improvements

Source: comparison vs tintinweb/pi-subagents (cloned at /tmp/pi-subagents).
Order below is priority order from the review; items marked done get a [x].

## Quick wins (render.ts + a few call sites in index.ts)

- [ ] 1. Cost display everywhere
      We aggregate usage.cost.total but never render it. Add `~$0.0042` to
      statsParts(), renderSummaryResults, renderNotification, plus a batch
      total in the combined toast (`3 agents · ~$0.042`). Rule: print NOTHING
      when there is no pricing data (never `$0.00`); `<$0.0001` floor;
      cents minimum / 4 decimals max.

- [ ] 2. Deadline visibility
      timed_out is our signature failure mode and it is invisible until hit.
      Show `⏱ 4.1s / 300s` in the stats line; tint warning >80% of budget,
      error >95%. Data: profile.timeoutSeconds / config.defaultTimeoutSeconds
      already flow into RunnerRequest.timeoutMs — plumb into TaskStatus or
      keep in PreparedTask and pass alongside statuses.

- [ ] 3. Toast latency fix
      flushPendingNotifications fires only when the LAST run finishes; a fast
      agent's result is invisible until its slowest sibling ends. Debounce
      ~2–5s after each terminal transition instead. Worst case two toasts
      merge, best case results arrive when they happen.

- [ ] 4. Rich collapsed tool result
      `⎿ Done` says nothing to the user OR the orchestrator model. Render:
      `⎿ ✓ succeeded · 12.4k tok · $0.008 · 41s · artifacts: /tmp/pi-subagent-x`
      and first line of errorMessage on failure. All data already in
      details.results. NOTE: keep model-facing plain text ANSI-free — style
      only the renderResult component (user-facing).

## Medium effort

- [ ] 5. Lean into tmux (our differentiator)
      - Persistent attach hint in widget footer: `attach: tmux attach -t pi-subagents:@N`
      - `/subagents` slash command: list runs; actions = attach/switch
        (`tmux switch-client -t` inside tmux, print command otherwise),
        kill task, copy transcript path.
      - Optional `cancel` param on run_subagents keyed by taskId so the MODEL
        can stop a hung subagent without killing the whole call.

- [ ] 6. Per-agent identity colors
      Hash profile name -> small stable palette for badge/icon in widget rows,
      notifications, AND the agent's tmux pane-border-format so pane and
      widget row correspond visually.

- [ ] 7. Prompt noise in full-mode results
      renderResults echoes system prompt + task prompt per task (50KB cap).
      The coordinator wrote the task; drop the system prompt echo entirely,
      keep task prompt behind expanded view. pi-subagents echoes neither.

- [ ] 8. Smarter widget overflow
      renderWidgetLines: (a) finished tasks yield rows to active ones instead
      of truncating past the 12-line cap; (b) informative overflow:
      `└─ +3 more · 1 failed`.

## Polish

- [x] 9. Distinguish `starting` from `running`
      Both showed a spinner; dim `(starting)` label now appears in widget
      rows and tmux pane titles until the first runner status lands.
      Tests: __tests__/render.test.ts.

- [ ] 10. Artifact pointer in success notifications
      renderNotification should include result_path for succeeded summary-mode
      tasks — the single most useful line for research loops.

- [x] 11. Style section headings
      renderSectionHeading accepts optional WidgetTheme; icon + state word
      colored with the same mapping as iconFor(). Plain-text default kept —
      model-facing result text must stay ANSI-free.

- [ ] 12. Window-title elapsed honesty
      renderWindowTitle computes elapsed from runs[0].startedAt only;
      sequential batches understate age. Track oldest active run start.
